            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Fluttabyes is a bright, cheerful, and fun take on a &quot;Match 3&quot; game. Easy to pick up and play, and thoroughly addictive! Your aim is to help the butterflies fly away by matching 4 or more of the same colour. Earn score multipliers by creating matches very quickly. If you match more than 6 butterflies you will earn a ladybird. If you match more than 9 butterflies, you will earn the magical rainbow butterfly!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are different modes of play:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSURVIVAL - Race against the dandelion clock and earn more time by freeing butterflies.<br />\r\nENDLESS - There is no time limit so you can perfect your match-making skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are online leaderboards for each mode so you can compete with other &quot;Fluttabytes&quot; around the world! Can you beat the number 1?",
            "about_the_game": "Fluttabyes is a bright, cheerful, and fun take on a &quot;Match 3&quot; game. Easy to pick up and play, and thoroughly addictive! Your aim is to help the butterflies fly away by matching 4 or more of the same colour. Earn score multipliers by creating matches very quickly. If you match more than 6 butterflies you will earn a ladybird. If you match more than 9 butterflies, you will earn the magical rainbow butterfly!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are different modes of play:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSURVIVAL - Race against the dandelion clock and earn more time by freeing butterflies.<br />\r\nENDLESS - There is no time limit so you can perfect your match-making skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are online leaderboards for each mode so you can compete with other &quot;Fluttabytes&quot; around the world! Can you beat the number 1?",
